{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00458","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 赤帝徵音 肃和 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 赤帝徵音 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离位克明，火中宵见。\n峰云暮起，景风晨扇。\n木槿初荣，含桃可荐。\n芬馥百品，铿锵三变。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}